  <div style="background:var(--surface-1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:24px;">
    <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:var(--text-1);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:16px;">Security Architecture</h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Every lab runs on fully isolated infrastructure:</p>

    <div style="display:grid;gap:12px;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--sage);background:rgba(107,207,143,0.1);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">ORIGIN</span>
        <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);">Lab apps run on separate origins (workers.dev). The browser's Same-Origin Policy prevents any interaction with penumbraforge.com.</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--sage);background:rgba(107,207,143,0.1);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">SANDBOX</span>
        <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);">Each lab is embedded in a sandboxed iframe without same-origin access. Even XSS within the lab cannot escape the iframe boundary.</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--sage);background:rgba(107,207,143,0.1);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">ISOLATE</span>
        <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);">Workers execute in V8 isolates with no filesystem, no persistent state, and no access to other Workers or Cloudflare account resources.</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;">
        <span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--sage);background:rgba(107,207,143,0.1);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">SIMULATED</span>
        <span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);">No real databases, servers, or cloud resources are involved. SSRF targets are simulated endpoints. SQL runs in browser-side WASM. All data is fake.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="background:rgba(232,184,77,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(232,184,77,0.12);border-radius:14px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:24px;">
    <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;color:#e8b84d;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:12px;">Legal Notice</h2>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;">Unauthorized access to computer systems is illegal under the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (18 U.S.C. § 1030) and equivalent laws worldwide. The techniques demonstrated in these labs should <strong style="color:var(--text-1);">only be used against systems you own or have explicit written authorization to test</strong>.</p>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7;margin-top:10px;">Penumbra Forge provides these labs for educational purposes only. We are not responsible for any misuse of the knowledge gained from these exercises. By using these labs, you agree to use the skills and knowledge obtained exclusively for lawful and authorized purposes.</p>
